      ],
      "source": "https://www.egremonthistoricalcommission.org/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Egremont’s name origin is unclear, possibly after the English town or Charles Wyndham, 2nd Earl of Egremont.",
